   "design": "A regional provider list ({OTHER}) shared by local practices shows who treats what and their waiting times. A referral template in the patient record fills client details, test results and goals, and the therapist writes the question; once the therapist has checked the letter, it goes by secure mail. Deciding, discussing and consulting stay with the therapist.",
